    weave transpose into Mat4:
        return with m00 is self->m00 , m01 is self->m10 , m02 is self->m20 , m03 is self->m30 , m10 is self->m01 , m11 is self->m11 , m12 is self->m21 , m13 is self->m31 , m20 is self->m02 , m21 is self->m12 , m22 is self->m22 , m23 is self->m32 , m30 is self->m03 , m31 is self->m13 , m32 is self->m23 , m33 is self->m33

    weave determinant into float:
